  "prefLabel": "Puc 602.07 Order nisi",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 602.07 \"Order nisi\" means an order that will ripen or take effect at some set date in the future unless the order is rescinded by the commission before that date.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 600) #13887, eff 2-22-24",
